{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Yeah, earlier today it was taking a nap at the port in Ferrytown.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:45:32.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427315411812373","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I thought it was normal in these parts?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:46:42.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427611772682240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Well, the hatred of the Reds is as strong in the dinosaur as it is in the Artificer. I think that's the main reason we weren't eaten.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:46:45.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427622301564929","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Grimlock!!! My mama used to tell me stories about her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:46:51.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427647379701770","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
