{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Meorys turns to Sera, \"One day, you'll have to take me to meet her, yeah?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:47:20.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427769311395840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She gives another pat to Orphy","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:47:37.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427842606202880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Back in the days of the uh... Rowing Oak colony. They had this dinosaur named Grimlock who ran around town. Also, I don't know where she is so how can I take you to her? What a weird request.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:48:04.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864427954640388106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"And if you mean my mama, she's kinda dead. It's been *years* andyearsandyearsandyears.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:49:02.389000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T08:49:19.823000Z","id":"864428196686462977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You'll have to tell me that story of Grimlock sometime. As for your mother, I am sorry for your loss.\" She lowered her head slightly as she spoke those last few words.","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:50:04.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864428457600221185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Ehhhh. She deserved it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:50:37.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864428594414354432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"That's... an odd thing to say, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:51:02.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864428700954656798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
