{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Her eyes widened, the golden yellow becoming more obvious now that her eyes weren't as heavy now. \"People actually have a hatred of their parents that they aren't saddened by their passing?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:52:46.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864429135970828309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"There's been a misunderstanding. My mama isn't one of my parents. She's my mama..... I can see why this is confusing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:53:39.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864429359724756992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I'm not sure if I understand, but if you say so, I'll accept that. Can't say it's any different when I'm telling people about my swarm. Well, used to tell, I suppose. Not many people around since the curfew came into effect.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:54:48.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864429649420091403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
