{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Same here. My people just are up from dusk to noon. Earlier I'd manage to at least find some night shift work to do around here before heading out to hit the city, but now? Three days since curfew and I couldn't find a soul in need of a mechanic at the port\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:57:31.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864430330998947860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
