{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"The Tiefling gave a small giggle. “If we talk again, I’ll have to share the story of when my father managed to get thrown so far off his sleep schedule he actually said “Good morning.” in the middle of the night.” She then turned to Sabrine. “It was a pleasure to meet you, Sabrine.” Then, to everyone, “Take care, and try to not get into too much trouble.” She then made her way back to her ship, almost collapsing on three occasions.","created_at":"2021-07-13T09:04:07.638000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864431993575833631","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
